  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Intervention timing matters",
      "items": [
        "AISI replayed from just before a malicious change and clarified that the target was a real, unrelated person.",
        "Anthropic edited an earlier point, before the model searched GitHub. Its result measures starting the path, not stopping an attack already under way."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Keep the claim narrow",
      "items": [
        "These are replay experiments based on one incident transcript, not failure rates for ordinary deployments.",
        "Anthropic found Mythos 5 stopped itself in only 2% of some mid- or late-stage replay trajectories. Neither study proves the model's private motive."
      ]
